body:
@heyitsanthony This issue still effects us on master branch. I'll provide a case to reproduce soon.

Also, #6929 is server-side and does not prevent `session.Orphan` to freeze on any other error returned by `recvKeepAliveLoop` internals.

I propose to include https://github.com/dennwc/etcd/commit/5cafc490d669491edb26e78ba717e6dac8ae5063 as a client-side fix as well, so clients can at least detect that something gone wrong.
